# Without a `name!` rule the first rule is the start symbol, even an
# alias; the rules after it are then unreachable.
# error: unreachable_alias_start.grammar:15:1:
# error: rule 's' is unreachable: no start symbol reaches it
@lexer
tokens
    ident
    eof
    err
[ \t\n]+ → skip
[a-z]+ → ident
. → err
@parser
name = IDENT
s    = name name                            → (s 1 2)
